	<div style="background-color:;display:block !important;" class="p-6 rounded-5 bg-light mb-18" data-zesty-id="design:columns:1 Column:23:65">
<div style="flex:1" className={styles.pvlColumn} class="column" data-zesty-id="design:columns:1 Column:23:65-1:1 Column:0">
<h5 style="text-align:center;" data-zesty-id="content:text:1:85">Ship Supplies Directly To The Salvation Army of Greenville Through one of These Trusted Retailers:</h5>
<h5 data-zesty-id="content:text:2:26">Target Shelter&nbsp;Registry</h5>
<p data-zesty-id="content:textarea:3:28">
	The Salvation Army of Greenville serves our community every day through our Men's and Women's shelters. Please consider donating these essential items, and be assured that they will go directly to those in need.
</p>
<p data-zesty-id="content:wysiwyg_basic:4:77">
	<span class="btn btn-solid btn-red"><a href="https://www.target.com/gift-registry/gift/tsashelterneeds" target="">The Salvation Army of Greenville's Shelter Needs&nbsp;</a>Target Registry</span>
</p>
<div class="my-2" data-zesty-id="design:design:whitespace-sm:5:62"></div>
<hr data-zesty-id="design:design:horizontalrule:6:66">
<h5 data-zesty-id="content:text:7:82">Target Red Shield Youth Center&nbsp;Registry</h5>
<p data-zesty-id="content:textarea:8:1">
	The Red Shield Youth Center&nbsp;of Greenville provides a fun, safe, and constructive environment for kids and teens during out-of-school hours, including summer and after school. Donate supplies through the Target Registry now.&nbsp;
</p>
<p data-zesty-id="content:wysiwyg_basic:9:53">
	<span class="btn btn-solid btn-red"><a href="https://www.target.com/gift-registry/gift/bandgclub" target="">The Salvation Army's Red Shield Youth Center&nbsp;</a>Target Registry</span>
</p>
<div class="my-2" data-zesty-id="design:design:whitespace-sm:10:10"></div>
<hr data-zesty-id="design:design:horizontalrule:11:63">
<h5 data-zesty-id="content:text:12:21">Walmart Registry for Good</h5>
<p data-zesty-id="content:textarea:13:31">
	Safely and securely shop Walmart's Registry for Good online to send items to support our Men's and Women's shelters and food pantry.
</p>
<p data-zesty-id="content:wysiwyg_basic:14:0">
	<a href="https://www.walmart.com/registry/RR/f6ed9171-0c73-4dac-8e44-3c7c56bf04ad"><span class="btn btn-solid btn-red">Walmart Registry for Good</span></a>
</p>
<div class="my-2" data-zesty-id="design:design:whitespace-sm:15:75"></div>
<hr data-zesty-id="design:design:horizontalrule:16:48">
<h5 data-zesty-id="content:text:17:67">Amazon Registry</h5>
<p data-zesty-id="content:textarea:18:71">
	Shop online at Amazon for some of our most needed items in our men's, women's, and children's emergency shelters. Items will be delivered directly to The Salvation Army of Greenville.
</p>
<p data-zesty-id="content:wysiwyg_basic:19:18">
	<a href="https://www.amazon.com/registries/gl/guest-view/2JECQHIL6GX26"><span class="btn btn-solid btn-red">Amazon Registry</span></a>
</p>
